OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pulls support for future
OL,4,Ajobs fairs with British Army
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerry City and Strabane District
OL,7,FCouncil has voted to withdraw any
OL,8,Finvolvement in the organisation or
OL,9,Fmarketing of any future jobs fair that
OL,10,Fincludes the British Armed Forces.
OL,12,FProposed by Sinn Fein councillor
OL,13,FChristopher Jackson, the motion stated
OL,14,Fthat the presence of the British Armed
OL,15,FForces at a recent jobs fair organised
OL,16,Fby the Department for Communities (DfC)
OL,17,Fhad acted as a "barrier" for some
OL,18,Fpeople seeking employment
OL,19,Fopportunities.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
