OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pulls support for future
OL,4,Ajobs fairs with British Army
OL,5,
OL,6,FJackson said the legacy of the Armed
OL,7,FForces in Londonderry had been one of
OL,8,F"trauma, hurt and destruction".
OL,10,FDUP councillor Niree McMorris said the
OL,11,Fmotion would limit employment
OL,12,Fopportunities and accused council of
OL,13,Fpoliticising employment opportunities.
